WEBVTT

00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:05.887
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:10.158
Delivers this message

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:19.162
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:20.771
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:28.880
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.175
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:36.683
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.921 --> 00:00:41.051
But please don't look back

00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:45.219
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.429 --> 00:00:49.525
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.236
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.504 --> 00:00:57.406
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.808 --> 00:01:01.403
Delivers this message

00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:10.083
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.454 --> 00:01:18.657
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.096 --> 00:01:28.767
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:33.700
Shurei's group, who
had quietly entered...

00:01:33.778 --> 00:01:36.212
...the blockaded capital
of Sa Province, Koren...

00:01:36.948 --> 00:01:40.111
...came across a letter from
Sakujun at their hideout.

00:01:42.587 --> 00:01:45.647
It was an invitation to the selection
ceremony for the head of the Sa Clan.

00:01:47.758 --> 00:01:50.727
Meanwhile, Kokujun was determined
to stop his grandfather, Chusho...

00:01:50.795 --> 00:01:53.195
...and his older brother, Sakujun.

00:01:54.432 --> 00:01:56.127
However his desperate
pleas were in vain...

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.168
...and he was thrown
into a dungeon.

00:02:14.418 --> 00:02:16.386
F-Father?

00:02:17.622 --> 00:02:22.582
A Diamond in the Rough

00:02:29.433 --> 00:02:31.424
So you're going after all, Princess?

00:02:31.802 --> 00:02:32.996
Well, I've received an invitation.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:36.437
Besides, I must get my
flower bud back from him.

00:02:38.609 --> 00:02:40.577
I'll go wherever that man is.

00:02:40.978 --> 00:02:42.673
But, My Lady...!

00:02:42.747 --> 00:02:45.147
That's right, Shurei. It's dangerous!

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.147
Thank you for worrying
about me. But I...!

00:02:49.787 --> 00:02:52.347
Please don't forget that I love you.

00:02:53.357 --> 00:02:56.451
Please don't forget. I love you.

00:02:57.028 --> 00:02:59.690
I must meet with him face to face.

00:03:00.998 --> 00:03:02.966
My Lady...!

00:03:17.114 --> 00:03:18.979
I've come to collect you.

00:03:21.919 --> 00:03:23.887
When did he get here?

00:03:24.855 --> 00:03:26.686
You're awfully early.

00:03:26.757 --> 00:03:30.716
This man must be Mr. Sakujun.
He's a beautiful man, isn't he?

00:03:31.962 --> 00:03:33.589
His looks are all that's
good about him.

00:03:33.664 --> 00:03:35.859
Even if he tells you that he'll
give you sweets, don't follow him!

00:03:36.334 --> 00:03:38.802
Seiran, I'm not so much a
child that I'd fall for that.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:43.136
If I sold a portrait of him,
I'm sure I could make a decent profit.

00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:47.809
Cut it out, Sho! What are you
calculating something like that for?!

00:03:47.912 --> 00:03:49.880
Do you realize the situation we're in?

00:03:55.286 --> 00:03:56.719
My Lady!

00:03:57.488 --> 00:03:59.922
I'll go with you.
Thank you for your invitation.

00:04:00.825 --> 00:04:02.793
Good. I'm happy to hear that.

00:04:03.728 --> 00:04:06.856
I guess I haven't grown
tired of you yet.

00:04:18.843 --> 00:04:20.743
That's dangerous, Little Whirlwind.

00:04:21.212 --> 00:04:24.238
Excuse me. There was this fly
that was getting on my nerves.

00:04:24.882 --> 00:04:26.850
Your speech and
skills have degraded.

00:04:27.318 --> 00:04:28.945
You must be preoccupied
with meaningless hardship.

00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:30.179
I feel sorry for you.

00:04:30.421 --> 00:04:33.185
At least I'm lucky enough not to
become like a certain foolish lord...

00:04:33.257 --> 00:04:36.021
...whose brains have rotted away
from too much fooling around.

00:04:38.796 --> 00:04:40.957
Wow, you can be pretty scary,
Mr. Seiran.

00:04:41.031 --> 00:04:43.829
But Mr. Sakujun isn't shaken one bit!

00:04:44.769 --> 00:04:48.535
They're both incredible.
I've gotta try harder, too.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.203
At what?

00:04:51.275 --> 00:04:53.243
What are you doing?
I thought we were going.

00:04:54.311 --> 00:04:55.335
Goodbye, everyone.

00:04:55.413 --> 00:04:57.779
Since he's gone to the trouble of
coming for me, I'll be on my way.

00:04:58.382 --> 00:05:00.350
See you later, Little Whirlwind.

00:05:05.389 --> 00:05:07.914
I'm gonna have you give me back
my flower bud no matter what.

00:05:19.603 --> 00:05:21.230
Well...

00:05:21.639 --> 00:05:23.834
Now that the diamond has
been taken out of the rough...

00:05:23.908 --> 00:05:25.933
...we're left with just us guys!

00:05:26.911 --> 00:05:30.972
That was impressive, Seiran. You held
it in well. Why don't I give you a hug?

00:05:32.316 --> 00:05:34.284
No way!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.020
This is the residence of
that important man in Kinka!

00:05:46.096 --> 00:05:48.564
I shall now fulfill that request by Ensei...

00:05:48.632 --> 00:05:52.295
...to talk to the big man in
Kinka on our way to Koren!

00:05:57.408 --> 00:05:58.773
Here you go.

00:05:58.876 --> 00:05:59.934
Thank you.

00:06:00.978 --> 00:06:01.672
Here you go.

00:06:02.046 --> 00:06:03.206
Good evening!

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.718
Excuse me for interrupting so
late at night.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:15.187
I am Yoshun, the deputy leader of
the Bald Eagles of Sa Province.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.427
Official Yu...!

00:06:17.561 --> 00:06:20.052
Yes. This guest seems
to be here to see me.

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:25.993
Oh, do not stand. Seeing that you have
trouble walking, please remain seated.

00:06:27.238 --> 00:06:29.206
How did you know?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.438
You looked just like a wild
deer with an injured leg.

00:06:34.445 --> 00:06:37.744
I heard about you from Ensei Ro.
Very good to see you.

00:06:38.382 --> 00:06:42.011
Yoshun, the famous deputy leader
of the Bald Eagles of Sa Province.

00:06:43.153 --> 00:06:47.487
I-I'm merely the deputy leader. I'm
just in training and not famous at all!

00:06:47.925 --> 00:06:52.794
Oh, but my big brother...
Boss Shorin is famous!

00:06:57.401 --> 00:06:58.299
Here you are.

00:06:58.402 --> 00:07:00.131
Ah, thank you very much.

00:07:05.242 --> 00:07:09.110
That was very nice.
At last, I'm feeling relaxed.

00:07:12.149 --> 00:07:14.617
Would you be the most
important person here?

00:07:14.985 --> 00:07:20.082
Yes indeed. I am appointed the
highest ranked post in Kinka.

00:07:20.758 --> 00:07:23.226
Well, that's amazing
for someone so young.

00:07:23.627 --> 00:07:25.822
I am very honored to
receive your compliment.

00:07:26.597 --> 00:07:29.896
So, where are your leader
and Lady Shunki Sa?

00:07:30.968 --> 00:07:32.959
They're on their way to Koren.

00:07:34.438 --> 00:07:38.670
But I understand Koren is blockaded,
so it's not going to be easy to enter.

00:07:39.276 --> 00:07:42.939
This totally awesome fellow
gave us a wooden token!

00:07:43.347 --> 00:07:46.976
When he did, Miss Shunki said it would
be all right, they'd be able to enter.

00:07:48.652 --> 00:07:49.949
The wooden token was blue...

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.954
...with a picture of dragons and
a lotus flower on it.

00:07:52.389 --> 00:07:55.324
There sure are some amazing
young men in the big city!

00:07:56.827 --> 00:08:00.957
May I ask, what was it about this
person that struck you as amazing?

00:08:01.298 --> 00:08:02.959
His outfit!

00:08:03.033 --> 00:08:05.001
The feathers, the color
coordination...

00:08:05.069 --> 00:08:07.731
...and the shape were unique
and incredibly cool!

00:08:08.472 --> 00:08:12.306
Umm... By any chance,
did he carry a flute with him?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.708
Yeah. He made a
wonderful sound with it.

00:08:17.181 --> 00:08:19.081
Could he be that guy
from the Ran Clan?

00:08:23.253 --> 00:08:26.848
Refined city folk are so amazing!

00:08:27.725 --> 00:08:28.521
Is that right?

00:08:28.592 --> 00:08:31.823
But I wouldn't say it has to do with
whether or not he's from a big city.

00:08:32.529 --> 00:08:36.966
I believe, in that person's case, it's
more his personality that is unique.

00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:53.709
You may pass.

00:08:53.784 --> 00:08:56.878
Miss Shunki, we've entered Koren,
the capital of Sa Province!

00:08:57.454 --> 00:09:01.151
It's thanks to that awesome fellow's
wooden token! Now let's see...

00:09:03.127 --> 00:09:05.595
I'll see what I can get from
these horses' hoof prints.

00:09:05.963 --> 00:09:08.431
A few of them suddenly
picked up the pace.

00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:11.134
They went this way.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.065
I can only imagine Ensei, who would've
broken through the checkpoint...

00:09:15.139 --> 00:09:17.198
...would cause a horse to make
such an irregular move.

00:09:17.274 --> 00:09:19.299
If we follow these tracks,
we'll find them.

00:09:20.244 --> 00:09:22.542
Miss Shunki. Hang on for
just a little longer.

00:09:27.184 --> 00:09:30.676
The stars... Shunki is
making her move.

00:09:32.122 --> 00:09:34.682
Shunki. Men are foolish.

00:09:35.526 --> 00:09:38.120
It's always the women who
must rescue them in the end.

00:09:38.929 --> 00:09:42.763
On top of that, that
man is so unreliable.

00:09:45.602 --> 00:09:48.070
I borrowed one of
Great-Uncle Enjun's books.

00:09:50.174 --> 00:09:52.142
If you'd like, we can read it together.

00:09:54.078 --> 00:09:57.172
Invite her out for a walk
or something! You fool!

00:10:00.417 --> 00:10:03.784
But he had the same
eyes as Enjun's.

00:10:04.254 --> 00:10:06.222
He's the man whom
Shunki has chosen.

00:10:06.824 --> 00:10:11.090
Perhaps he's inherited
Enjun's good qualities.

00:10:15.332 --> 00:10:18.096
What... What should I do?

00:10:19.269 --> 00:10:23.535
I was too late. I could stop neither
Grandfather nor brother Sakujun.

00:10:23.874 --> 00:10:28.368
It's over. The Sa Clan...

00:10:30.647 --> 00:10:31.773
Great-Uncle Enjun.

00:10:31.849 --> 00:10:36.479
What would you have done?
You could've done something.

00:10:37.888 --> 00:10:43.451
I had always admired you. But, there
was just one thing I didn't understand.

00:10:44.528 --> 00:10:47.759
Why did you kill all the heirs
of the main branch of the family?

00:10:50.033 --> 00:10:52.001
Why?

00:10:53.604 --> 00:10:56.129
Thank you very much for
getting in touch with me.

00:10:56.874 --> 00:10:58.501
You were very helpful.

00:10:58.742 --> 00:10:59.936
No, no, don't mention it.

00:11:00.477 --> 00:11:03.275
It's a chivalrous thief's duty to finish a
job that someone has asked of him.

00:11:03.881 --> 00:11:05.849
Now, I shall head to Koren!

00:11:06.817 --> 00:11:08.785
Where do you intend to go?

00:11:09.119 --> 00:11:11.087
I'm heading to where Boss is!

00:11:11.455 --> 00:11:13.923
Koren's under a blockade,
so you won't be able to enter.

00:11:14.858 --> 00:11:17.725
Actually, I was planning
to go to Koren too.

00:11:18.195 --> 00:11:21.164
If it's all right with you, could I have
you be my bodyguard on the way there?

00:11:22.065 --> 00:11:24.260
That way, we can enter
Koren together.

00:11:24.368 --> 00:11:25.767
Really?

00:11:26.036 --> 00:11:31.201
Would that really be okay? This
world is full of such kind people!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:36.773
But this job I'm asking is not without
its dangers. Are you sure about this?

00:11:37.247 --> 00:11:42.275
Is it as dangerous as being chased
by five hungry, man-eating bears?

00:11:45.656 --> 00:11:49.387
Maybe the big city's risks are
a lot worse than I imagined.

00:11:49.459 --> 00:11:51.051
Like maybe ten bears?

00:11:52.563 --> 00:11:55.361
I-I don't believe it will
be quite that dangerous.

00:11:57.868 --> 00:11:59.961
That's good to hear!

00:12:05.008 --> 00:12:09.968
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:16.386 --> 00:12:20.186
It will be all right. Princess
has a good head on her shoulders.

00:12:21.058 --> 00:12:22.525
Right.

00:12:22.593 --> 00:12:25.153
Once everything is over, you
can beat him up as you like.

00:12:26.263 --> 00:12:28.197
It won't be enough.

00:12:28.265 --> 00:12:30.893
In that guy's case, just
beating him up won't be enough!

00:12:32.336 --> 00:12:34.361
Don't do anything too distasteful.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.075
Cut it out, Seiran! Wait a moment!

00:12:45.282 --> 00:12:48.945
You idiot! Who swings a sword
when there's a young girl around?

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.651
Wow, guess the world's not
such a bad place.

00:12:54.057 --> 00:12:56.890
Just after we lose one diamond,
another one flies right into our arms.

00:12:59.196 --> 00:13:01.164
She's Shunki Sa.

00:13:09.673 --> 00:13:12.540
You said this building is detached from
the main residence of the Sa Clan, right?

00:13:12.609 --> 00:13:13.576
That's what I said.

00:13:13.644 --> 00:13:16.636
Why is everything so complicated
here? It seems so easy to get lost.

00:13:17.381 --> 00:13:19.349
It's like this in case of emergencies.

00:13:19.983 --> 00:13:24.784
So it's not easy to invade nor easy
to discern where people are.

00:13:25.589 --> 00:13:26.351
That sorta thing.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.980
From long ago this has
been a place...

00:13:28.058 --> 00:13:29.992
...of endless rebellions and
betrayals, after all.

00:13:30.727 --> 00:13:33.753
That's also what your
grandfather's doing, isn't it?

00:13:34.331 --> 00:13:35.764
You're right.

00:13:35.832 --> 00:13:40.269
Ah, yes. My going to get you was
an order from my grandfather.

00:13:40.971 --> 00:13:44.737
He told me to get you before anyone
had a chance to interrupt things.

00:13:45.409 --> 00:13:46.239
What?!

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:49.336
Then, apparently our wedding
ceremony can be held formally...

00:13:49.413 --> 00:13:52.075
...at the same time as the selection
ceremony for the head of the clan.

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:57.649
So you brought me here with
the intention of ravishing me?!

00:13:58.155 --> 00:14:00.146
Well, in the end, yes.

00:14:01.525 --> 00:14:04.983
Even if that were to happen,
I would not become your wife!

00:14:06.196 --> 00:14:11.190
Well, I'm not necessarily interested in the
structure of having a wife or a marriage.

00:14:13.971 --> 00:14:18.408
As long as you add color to the
boredom I experience daily...

00:14:18.475 --> 00:14:19.703
...I have no more to ask.

00:14:20.711 --> 00:14:22.975
Until you become tired of me, right?

00:14:24.081 --> 00:14:26.481
Yes. Until I become tired of you.

00:14:26.883 --> 00:14:28.851
You're taking me for
a fool, aren't you?

00:14:29.052 --> 00:14:31.850
I would've preferred to have
you grow tired of me by now.

00:14:32.656 --> 00:14:36.615
That way, all I'd need to do is
get my flower bud back, and leave.

00:14:39.596 --> 00:14:45.000
I suppose. But since you're special,
this might drag on for a while.

00:14:45.802 --> 00:14:49.465
The reason I came here is not
to relieve you of your boredom.

00:14:49.873 --> 00:14:51.841
I came to get my flower bud back.

00:14:52.376 --> 00:14:55.345
You said you didn't care whether
or not I became the governor.

00:14:56.079 --> 00:14:58.013
I did say that. But...

00:14:58.081 --> 00:15:01.414
...are you required to have your flower
to take the position of governor?

00:15:02.552 --> 00:15:06.545
Normally not. But it's necessary to me.

00:15:07.591 --> 00:15:10.059
I shall look forward to the time when the
flower bud that I've bestowed upon you...

00:15:10.327 --> 00:15:12.295
...fully blossoms.

00:15:15.632 --> 00:15:17.600
I understand. All right.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:22.502
I'll give it back to you. Now, let's see.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.808
You'll get it back the day of the selection
ceremony for the head of the Sa Clan.

00:15:25.942 --> 00:15:27.204
What did you say?

00:15:27.277 --> 00:15:28.938
Well, if I gave it back
to you right now...

00:15:29.012 --> 00:15:32.072
you'd probably flee in
the blink of an eye.

00:15:33.316 --> 00:15:36.547
I won't run away! Not until the
clan head's selection ceremony.

00:15:37.421 --> 00:15:40.857
Then there's no problem,
is there? I'll keep my promise.

00:15:41.625 --> 00:15:42.353
Very well!

00:15:42.826 --> 00:15:45.090
Come. Your room is over here.

00:15:48.965 --> 00:15:52.924
Can I ask you something?
Kokujun has come back here, right?

00:15:53.703 --> 00:15:54.226
Yes.

00:15:54.471 --> 00:15:56.234
What is he doing now?

00:15:57.808 --> 00:15:58.297
What?

00:15:58.408 --> 00:16:01.138
Yeah, you're right.
He's definitely here.

00:16:02.212 --> 00:16:06.410
But that's an issue within the Sa Clan.
It doesn't concern you, does it?

00:16:07.217 --> 00:16:09.685
Can't I be worried about
him as an individual?

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:12.454
All right, then. He's well.

00:16:12.522 --> 00:16:15.082
Wait a minute! How do you
expect me to believe you...

00:16:15.158 --> 00:16:17.388
...when you say it in such
a patronizing manner?

00:16:18.028 --> 00:16:20.394
Then why don't you try
searching for him yourself?

00:16:20.831 --> 00:16:23.299
You're free to do anything
you want while you're here.

00:16:23.467 --> 00:16:25.935
I don't care what you do or where
you search while you're here.

00:16:26.436 --> 00:16:27.733
Of course, not just the
separate residence...

00:16:27.804 --> 00:16:29.135
...but you can search the
main building too.

00:16:29.639 --> 00:16:31.539
What you're saying is, Mr. Kokujun...

00:16:31.608 --> 00:16:34.941
...is some place where even if I
searched wouldn't find him.

00:16:44.287 --> 00:16:46.755
Oh, is that a map of the
Sa Clan's compound?

00:16:47.124 --> 00:16:51.117
That's impressive. To be able
to draw it this accurately.

00:16:51.528 --> 00:16:53.792
Even taking into consideration
that she lived there for so long...

00:16:53.864 --> 00:16:56.094
...it's impressive to see how
much detail she remembers.

00:16:56.166 --> 00:16:59.226
Wow, Koyu would definitely
get lost there!

00:17:02.606 --> 00:17:04.597
I wonder if they've returned to Kiyo.

00:17:15.152 --> 00:17:17.620
It would've been better if
we had met her in Kinka.

00:17:22.125 --> 00:17:24.093
Shurei.

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:28.598
This is your room.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.299
If there's anything you'd
like, I'll get it for you.

00:17:35.172 --> 00:17:38.664
But once night falls, I'd like you to play
the erhu and make some tea for me.

00:17:39.442 --> 00:17:40.670
Also...

00:17:42.679 --> 00:17:44.647
I'd like you to wear your hair like this.

00:17:45.782 --> 00:17:48.910
I've said it many times.
I prefer it this way.

00:17:52.689 --> 00:17:54.657
So, is there anything
that you'd like to ask me?

00:17:55.825 --> 00:17:57.417
Can I send letters?

00:17:57.494 --> 00:17:59.792
That's not my jurisdiction.

00:18:00.564 --> 00:18:03.533
Even if you could, it would be under the
condition that the letter gets checked.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.965
You'd go that far?

00:18:06.036 --> 00:18:08.061
I think grandfather
would go that far.

00:18:09.206 --> 00:18:11.174
I understand.

00:18:11.374 --> 00:18:13.865
If there's nothing else,
why don't we go to my room?

00:18:15.278 --> 00:18:19.738
It's just next door. You'll play the erhu
for me, right? I have it there for you.

00:18:32.329 --> 00:18:35.093
Oh, before you play the erhu,
could you make me some tea?

00:18:35.632 --> 00:18:38.100
There are several kinds
of tea leaves over there.

00:18:42.272 --> 00:18:44.172
And of course,
I have Gan Lu tea too...

00:18:44.241 --> 00:18:46.709
...so you could make me some
of that if you'd like.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.246
It's delicious.

00:18:58.355 --> 00:18:59.583
Thank you.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:05.027
But... I'd rather drink
Gan Lu tea made by you.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.738
There are walls and passages
in such strange places.

00:19:15.805 --> 00:19:17.773
It's quite complicated, isn't it?

00:19:18.041 --> 00:19:20.601
Anyone would get lost
in here. Not just Koyu!

00:19:21.811 --> 00:19:25.577
It's equipped with various traps.
What an incredible residence!

00:19:26.283 --> 00:19:28.308
But this is quite helpful.

00:19:29.085 --> 00:19:31.349
Shall we copy it and
deliver it to Her Ladyship?

00:19:31.955 --> 00:19:33.923
Good idea.

00:19:35.325 --> 00:19:36.189
Shorin.

00:19:36.259 --> 00:19:39.057
As second-generation leader of the
Bald Eagles of Sa Province...

00:19:39.129 --> 00:19:40.960
...I have another job for you.

00:19:41.031 --> 00:19:43.465
There's a young lady in the Sa Clan's
residence that I want you to look for.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.462
I want you to get in
touch with her.

00:19:45.568 --> 00:19:46.364
What?!

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:50.106
Ensei. You really should stay out
of other people's private affairs!

00:19:50.507 --> 00:19:52.975
A chivalrous thief doesn't ask
for anything in return, right?

00:19:53.209 --> 00:19:55.677
Besides, it's Lord Shoka's daughter
you need to get in touch with.

00:19:56.246 --> 00:19:59.181
Why didn't you tell me that first?
If it's the daughter of Mr. Shoka...

00:19:59.416 --> 00:20:02.749
...who did favors for my father, it's
obvious that I'll gladly search for her!

00:20:03.086 --> 00:20:05.281
That's what I expect from a
chivalrous thief! Knowing you...

00:20:05.388 --> 00:20:07.185
...you can just listen for the
sound of erhu music...

00:20:07.257 --> 00:20:08.554
and you'll find her in no time.

00:20:09.192 --> 00:20:12.093
After all, you're what wild
children would call a wild child.

00:20:14.064 --> 00:20:15.531
Was that a compliment?

00:20:15.899 --> 00:20:16.695
I dunno.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:21.296
But you must be quiet and discreet
so that no one will find you but her.

00:20:21.671 --> 00:20:27.166
So it's a stealth job? Certainly a job
fit for a chivalrous thief! I like it.

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:29.578
Then wake me up when the
map's ready.

00:20:29.646 --> 00:20:33.207
I'm taking a nap to
store up some stamina.

00:20:40.523 --> 00:20:42.491
Wow, he's already asleep.

00:20:43.226 --> 00:20:45.160
That's because he's a wild child.

00:20:45.228 --> 00:20:47.162
But just because he's a wild child...

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:50.859
Depending on only the sound of
the erhu in such a big residence...

00:20:51.501 --> 00:20:53.492
...I wonder if he'll be
able to find Shurei.

00:20:55.138 --> 00:20:58.835
Don't worry. His animal
instincts can be trusted.

00:20:59.409 --> 00:21:01.377
He's the same
guy who found us here...

00:21:01.444 --> 00:21:03.435
...following hoof prints from
the checkpoint.

00:21:04.047 --> 00:21:06.379
I guess you're right.
He's quite something.

00:21:07.317 --> 00:21:09.785
It's not like there's
only one horse in Koren.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.748
Even so... When I look
at him and you...

00:21:14.224 --> 00:21:16.692
...it's amazing how different you
can be at the same age, Eigetsu.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:21.797
Same age? What?!
You serious?

00:21:21.898 --> 00:21:22.626
Yup.

00:21:25.101 --> 00:21:27.069
I'll have to work harder.

00:21:35.011 --> 00:21:36.979
This is a well drawn map.

00:21:37.247 --> 00:21:39.772
Now, let's copy the
map for Princess.

00:21:41.451 --> 00:21:45.410
This young lady is a lot more
help to us than Kokujun was.

00:21:46.623 --> 00:21:51.526
When the going gets tough, girls tend
to be braver and stronger than guys.

00:21:59.068 --> 00:22:01.036
Yes, they're strong.

00:22:10.747 --> 00:22:15.775
Is that so? I see. So that's
how it was, Great-Uncle Enjun.

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:19.516
The reason you killed all the heirs
from the main branch of the clan...

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:23.552
...was because it was too
late to do otherwise.

00:22:24.661 --> 00:22:27.858
There was no longer
anything else you could do.

00:22:29.098 --> 00:22:34.126
To that extent, this family,
the Sa Clan, was rotten.

00:22:36.039 --> 00:22:41.170
So there was nothing you could do
but start all over from scratch.

00:22:43.746 --> 00:22:46.214
At this point, all I can do...

00:22:47.217 --> 00:22:51.347
...is bring everything to
an end with my own hands.

00:22:54.424 --> 00:22:56.858
Just like Great-Uncle Enjun did.

00:23:06.302 --> 00:23:07.667
Father.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:35.657
You've always led a very carefree
life and right now

00:23:35.798 --> 00:23:42.362
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.472 --> 00:23:47.535
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.644 --> 00:23:52.638
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.716 --> 00:23:58.176
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.722 --> 00:24:04.853
You are just like me

00:24:05.595 --> 00:24:10.123
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.199 --> 00:24:16.104
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.073 --> 00:24:22.875
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.979 --> 00:24:27.848
I will always think of you

00:24:28.985 --> 00:24:41.659
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.101 --> 00:24:45.635
Next Episode

00:24:45.635 --> 00:24:48.438
Next Episode
Darn. Erhu this, erhu that... I'm
surprised that man never gets tired of it!

00:24:48.438 --> 00:24:49.639
Next Episode
